WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Size: six whole flying pigs

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,320
Of these six pills alone, half will be handed over to the research center according to the agreement.

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,720
There is also a valuation of around 60 billion

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:08,120
This Jugui is simply a moving Bai Baokong

5
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,160
Got six flying pigs

6
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:11,080
Bring another thousand kilograms of Linggui meat back to taste the immortality

7
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:21,100
It's windy today. Go back to the city. Oh my God.

8
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:22,860
There is a woman on the treasure star

9
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:26,820
The stars didn't move at all

10
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,140
Is it a natural statue?

11
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,020
If it were extraterrestrial intelligent life

12
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:32,580
Can appear alone in an environment full of giant creatures

13
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,700
Neither technology nor survivability should be underestimated

14
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:37,470
Slowly lean over and take a look

15
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:42,820
But the surface is all bark and leaves

16
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,780
It shouldn't be an ordinary creature returning

17
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,970
No breathing or spontaneous movement

18
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:49,850
Is it really a kind of parasitic plant?
